{
  "info": {
    "name": "Psicometría API - Evaluados (8 pruebas)",
    "description": "Las 8 pruebas pedidas en la Parte 5 del taller para /api/evaluados:\n- 5 exitosas, una por endpoint: POST, GET (listar), GET por id, PUT y DELETE.\n- 2 con datos inválidos: POST y PUT (400 con mensaje general y detalle de campos en \"errores\").\n- 1 con identificador inexistente: GET /999999 (404).\n\nEjecutar en orden (Run collection): la petición 1 guarda el id creado en {{evaluadoId}} y la 8 lo elimina.\n\nRequisitos: base psicometria_db creada con los scripts de database/ y la API corriendo en {{baseUrl}} (ver evaluados-local.postman_environment.json).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "evaluadoId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. POST - Registrar evaluado (201)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Devuelve el evaluado con id', () => pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a('number'));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('evaluadoId', body.id);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Valentina\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz\",\n  \"email\": \"valentina.munoz.{{$timestamp}}@correo.cl\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2007-08-15\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"MEDIA\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. GET - Listar evaluados (200)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Devuelve un arreglo JSON', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. GET - Buscar evaluado por id (200)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('El id coincide', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().id).to.eql(Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('evaluadoId'))));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/{{evaluadoId}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. PUT - Actualizar evaluado (200)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Datos actualizados', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(body.apellido).to.eql('Muñoz Tapia');",
              "  pm.expect(body.nivelEducativo).to.eql('UNIVERSITARIO');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/{{evaluadoId}}",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Valentina\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz Tapia\",\n  \"email\": \"valentina.munoz.{{$timestamp}}@correo.cl\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2007-08-15\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"UNIVERSITARIO\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. POST - Registrar con datos inválidos (400)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('400 Bad Request', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Incluye mensaje general', () => pm.expect(body.message).to.be.a('string'));",
              "pm.test('Detalla los campos inválidos', () => {",
              "  ['nombre', 'apellido', 'email', 'fechaNacimiento', 'genero', 'nivelEducativo', 'activo']",
              "    .forEach(campo => pm.expect(body.errores).to.have.property(campo));",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"\",\n  \"apellido\": \"R\",\n  \"email\": \"no-es-un-email\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2999-01-01\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. PUT - Actualizar con datos inválidos (400)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('400 Bad Request', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Incluye mensaje general', () => pm.expect(body.message).to.be.a('string'));",
              "pm.test('Detalla los campos inválidos', () => {",
              "  ['nombre', 'email', 'fechaNacimiento'].forEach(campo => pm.expect(body.errores).to.have.property(campo));",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/{{evaluadoId}}",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Valentina123\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz\",\n  \"email\": \"correo-invalido\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2999-12-31\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"MEDIA\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. GET - Buscar id inexistente (404)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('404 Not Found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Incluye mensaje general', () => pm.expect(body.message).to.be.a('string'));",
              "pm.test('Mensaje comprensible', () => pm.expect(body.message).to.eql('Evaluado con id 999999 no encontrado'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/999999"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "8. DELETE - Eliminar evaluado (204)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/{{evaluadoId}}",
        "description": "La API responde 204 No Content (eliminación exitosa sin cuerpo)."
      }
    }
  ]
}
